# .easignore — controls what gets uploaded to EAS Build (NOT to git).
#
# We intentionally do NOT list .env here. When this file exists, EAS uses it
# instead of .gitignore to decide the build upload, so .env (which IS gitignored)
# gets included in the build only — that puts the EXPO_PUBLIC_* keys into this
# preview APK for Cameron's own phone testing, which AGENT-RULES explicitly allows
# (internal distribution, never a public/shipped build). The secret stays out of
# git. node_modules and .git are ignored by EAS automatically.
